    "tooltip": "**Invented.** Nothing like this is on your screen as far as I know — I have drawn the guard rather than the hole, because you said this is the screen the second analyst breaks something with.\n\nIf a Brief has already gone to clients, changing 0.70 and re-running produces a second document with the same name. That is your parked versioning problem, reached from a different direction."
   },
